# Work in progress screenshots

All images are current cloud Chromium UI proof using safe intercepted API fixtures. They are not live data for client@fundhub.ai. The red frame marks the page/state under review; the caption names the evidence context. WebP copies preserve captured screenshot width (except extraordinarily tall images scaled within WebP limits); raw PNG originals remain local test output. No production release.

